The Loam is one of four devils who have lately grown organized, with [[Divinity/Fiends/Sigzil Haight|the Shackle]], [[Divinity/Fiends/The Harlequin|the Harlequin]] and the Hooded.

The four are shown as four hands around one eye, the device of [[Divinity/The Eye|the Eye]] that woke them.
